==Trivia==
*Lion Dancer Cat's appearance and description reference the [[wikipedia:Lion dance|Chinese lion dance]].
*[[Ancient Egg: N202 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N202]], Ancient Egg: N204 and [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N004]] are currently the only [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]] whose Evolved and True Forms affect more than one trait with their abilities.
*The [[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)|event capsule's]] banner has a grammatical error in its description of Ancient Egg: N204. It says "Evolve it to it's True Form, and…?", but "it's" is incorrect here, and the phrase should read "its true form". The difference is that "its" is a possessive pronoun, whereas "it's" means "it is".

